wat00:- true | wat00(atom).
wat00(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"a") | wat01.
alternatively.
wat00(_):- put_console(c#"*") | wat01.

wat01:- true | wat01(1234).
wat01(X):- wait(X), put_console(c#"b") | wat02.
